          "active_cost": "30 MP",
          "active_description": "<p>Deal <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.ZyOMe6IkUTlBzfjw\" data-id=\"ZyOMe6IkUTlBzfjw\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Earth</strong></a>&nbsp;damage to all enemies.</p>",
